WEBVTT

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.670
SAKURADA

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:38.670
72 times since then...

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:41.460
After numerous failures...

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:44.280
...another chance has finally
come around, I guess.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:48.680
Today, at last, the brainiest of the
Rozen Maidens, Kanaria...

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.650
...will make the other
dolls pay, I guess?

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.520
But before that...

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.990
...and properly charge my energy
with a breakfast box, I guess?

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.400
I'll eat Kana's specially made
egg omelet with sugar...

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:05.170
...and work hard!

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.000
Thank you for the foo...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.540
Drawing pictures! Drawing pictures!

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:23.320
I'll draw everyone to look so cute!

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.440
You look like you're
having fun, Hina-Ichigo.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.060
Huh?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.450
What are you writing, Souseiseki?

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:37.430
A letter.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:41.810
Thanking Grandfather and Grandmother
for Suiseiseki's care...

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.170
...along with an update.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:45.670
Unyu? A letter?

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:53.680
The Letter

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:57.620
"Awake," "awake," "awake"...

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.670
To rouse, to wake up,
to become aware, was it?

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.860
"Behind." "Behind" is...

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:10.600
What?

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:13.600
To the rear... To the rear...

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.980
Let's see, next is "cacophony"...

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.340
Hm, "cacophony"...

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.210
Oh, dissonance...

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:24.710
I swear!

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:29.070
That puny human is also
Suiseiseki's master...

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:31.220
...yet he's all mushy with Shinku!

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:34.780
N-Not that Suiseiseki
cares anything about that.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.450
I'm completely unfazed!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.960
But it annoys me a little.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.040
What are you mad about?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.380
P-P-P-Puny Ichigo,
w-w-w-what are you talking about?

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.730
I-I-I-It's not like I'm roasting over
Jun and Shinku!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.900
Roasting?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.140
ROASTING?

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:58.730
Yes! That's it!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.440
There you have it.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:03.310
Unyu?

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:06.550
Moron! Moron! Moron!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.100
It doesn't really bother me, Pizzicato.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:15.190
I, Kanaria, won't be discouraged over
some measly egg omelet.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.390
Not over an egg omelet...

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.700
An egg omelet...

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.670
Ta-da! It's a garbage-eating machine!

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.900
Hey, what'll you do with that?

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:30.220
Do some cleaning, of course!

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:34.310
If I clean while Nori's away,
she'll surely be bowled over!

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:38.880
She'll no doubt reward us with
double flower-topped hamburger steaks!

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.320
Unyu!

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:43.550
D-Double flower-topped hamburger steaks!

00:04:44.390 --> 00:04:48.690
A-And Jun is certain to find
renewed respect for Suiseiseki!

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.270
Hina's gonna work hard!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.290
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.040
By the way,
how do you use this?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:56.930
Unyu?

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.440
Listen.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.940
To use a vacuum cleaner...

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.070
Right, right.

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:04.940
You stick its tail in like this...

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:06.940
Nori used it like this.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.880
And she made it mad, voom.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.500
It's not working.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:13.680
Hey! Are you sleeping?

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:16.780
No, as I said...

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:17.890
Darn it!

00:05:17.890 --> 00:05:21.520
If you don't wake up right now,
I'll tear your nose off!

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.820
Take that and that and that!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.790
Come on, come on! Here's some more!

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:32.030
What could that noise be?

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.030
What is it?
What happened?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.760
Nothing.

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.220
T-That's right.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.050
We haven't done anything.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:58.290
Unfortunately, the cleaning
plan was a failure.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.710
But I'll do things well
this time for sure!

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.800
I call it the great Operation: Lunch!

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:09.410
Unyu... But, but she said to
order out for lunch...

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:10.070
No!

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.070
We'll make a properly loving
home-cooked meal!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.990
Wow...

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:19.080
I'll make an amazingly
toothsome lunch...

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.280
...and give Jun a big,
shocking surprise!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.050
Now let's start, you puny runt!

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.320
All righty!

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.290
What about this?

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:34.210
Beat the eggs thoroughly
and season to taste...

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:35.300
To taste?

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.920
Whatever flavor you like.

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:38.800
Yeah!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.870
First, salt and pepper.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:43.570
We'll put in yogurt and
Mapollo chocolates!

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:47.260
What have you done, stupid Ichigo?

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:48.900
Unyuu too.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.860
That's awful harmony!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:51.810
There!

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.910
Something really smells...

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.160
The lactic acid bacteria
in the yogurt are utterly dead.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.720
It smells kind of sour...

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.730
That's why I said not to put sweet things
like Mapollo chocolates in!

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.520
Stupid Ichigo!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.610
But, but I was sure it would taste good.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:16.230
It was a mistake to let puny Ichigo
help with the seasoning.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.640
Just leave the rest to me.

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:20.640
Start
Cancel

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.560
I'll make a boiled egg.

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:25.810
They're easy to make in the microwave.

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:26.920
Unyu!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.650
Plump boiled eggs.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.910
Y-You can't!

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.680
What now?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.320
Oh?

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:53.770
W-W-Wha...

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.270
What the hell is this?

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.140
Please don't get mad at them.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:06.150
Those two were trying
to make lunch for you.

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:08.260
For me?

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.660
For me...

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.240
You've done enough.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.740
Would you be okay with pizza for lunch?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.540
Yeah!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.950
H-Hold on, what's the meaning of this?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.480
Why just Hina-Ichigo?

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:42.280
What's with you?

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.940
I-It's nothing.

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.500
It's nothing!

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:55.260
W-What was that for?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.900
I'm not getting you lunch!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.830
Try it.
I so dare you!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.880
I'll curse you for life!

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.530
Ow! Quit it!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:06.840
Shinku, would you fix the window glass?

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.080
I have to do it in the end?

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:20.450
Well, some cat or bird will eat it.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.610
Oh?

00:09:26.610 --> 00:09:28.730
I smell something sweet...

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:33.830
Could that be...

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:35.830
E-Egg omelet!

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.610
No! Again?
No way!

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.930
My egg omelet...

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.740
It's done!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.620
My letter's finished!

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:06.240
Puny Ichigo, what are you doing?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.550
I'm waiting for him
to come get my letter.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.140
Who's coming?

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.140
Mr. Black Goat, the mailman.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:17.810
With letters, you have
to go to a "mailbox"...

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:20.460
...and send it out yourself.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:21.550
Mailbox?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:29.500
A mailbox is always totally red,
covered in the blood of its victims...

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:34.060
...and it stands on one leg in the street
with its mouth gaping.

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:41.320
At a set time, it spills its
guts out to the mailman.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:45.540
It's a gatekeeper that tests people
who come to send letters.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:48.440
If a crybaby comes...

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.810
I-If it's a crybaby...

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:59.390
Thus, you'll be gobbled up head first.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.170
You'd better be careful, puny runt.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:04.540
M-Monster mailbox...

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:05.960
Scary...

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.960
I can't send a letter to Jun like this.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:11.330
A letter?

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:16.780
Hina copied what Souseiseki did
and wrote a letter to Jun.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.140
To thank him for earlier.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:20.970
Since I hadn't thanked him properly.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.130
<i>I-I hadn't thought of that!</i>

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.910
<i>Puny Ichigo is not to
be underestimated...</i>

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:51.460
H-Hey, Souseiseki.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:52.300
What?

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:57.140
U-Um, would you come with me
to send a letter...

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.610
To send out a letter...

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.030
Unyu? She disappeared.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:09.620
What?

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:14.950
I have something important to tell you,
sort of, not really.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.120
What?

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:19.950
<i>I won't let her beat me to it!</i>

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.630
<i>I'll give him a letter first!</i>

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.370
W-Wait, what did you want?

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.390
M-My goodness!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.100
The phone line's been cut!

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:36.810
It appears this mansion
itself is the enemy's trap.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.770
Shinku! Shinku!

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:40.920
What?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:42.920
This is a crucial moment.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.820
Hey, come with me!

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.400
I'm going out!

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:47.190
No!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.420
Outside is full of enemy traps!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.800
As Kun-kun says,
there are many dangers outside.

00:12:53.980 --> 00:12:54.830
Unyu...

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:57.730
But, but it's only for a little bit!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.280
No!

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.970
Those things are wandering
this neighborhood.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:03.660
Things?

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:04.860
Those things.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:07.640
Those things...
Detective Cat?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.310
Yes, cats!

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:14.440
Cats are the most barbaric
beasts in this world.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:19.320
My servant before last
owned a cat, and that time...

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.130
No!

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.860
I don't even want to remember!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:44.060
At any rate, to Rozen Maidens,
cats are the enemy.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:44.710
Do you understand?

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.400
The outside is full of dangers.

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:57.670
And Hina's never gone out alone...

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.460
But...

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.600
Berrybell!

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.500
What the...?

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:18.170
For a being related to Holie,
your moves are pretty lame.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.040
Let sleeping dogs lie.

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.570
Hina knows.

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:28.890
This bathroom's window is always open.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.670
Berrybell, don't say you don't want to.

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:35.420
You're Hina's artificial spirit,
so you're coming too!

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:40.930
Hina can do it too!
I just have to work up the courage!

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:47.170
With biscuits for a snack
and the letter, off I go!

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.110
No need to go to a mailbox.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.070
I'll just give it directly.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.910
But before that, I'll double check it
in the bathroom.

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.910
Sneaking in was successful
again, I guess.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:03.840
Now, just as planned, I'll claim them
as my victims, one by one.

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:11.410
S-Somehow...

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.060
It's kind of scary...

00:15:20.340 --> 00:15:21.360
Huh?

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:23.730
Someone left the bathroom door open.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:28.440
I don't really know what happened,
but once he reads this...

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.710
...even he'll be floored and
bewitched by my charm!

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.240
TO JUN

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.040
I can't wait!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.720
W-What are you doing?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.220
Prepare to meet your fate, I guess!

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.400
You're terrible.

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:57.200
The precious letter
I worked so hard to write...

00:15:57.730 --> 00:15:59.710
I didn't expect this, I guess...

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.190
Why you!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:04.280
How dare you do this to
my totally heartfelt letter?

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:05.770
C-Calm down!

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.310
It was a  little accident, I guess?

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.180
No excuses!

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:11.850
It's kind of noisy around here.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.920
Is it Hina-Ichigo again?

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:17.980
Sheesh, where'd she go?

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.520
I shouldn't have come
outside, after all.

00:16:57.390 --> 00:16:59.500
It's a dead end.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.540
That was scary,
but it didn't hurt.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.380
It's a cat!

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:24.390
Really?

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:25.840
Yes.

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:30.160
I told her not to go outside
because it's dangerous, but...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.260
She isn't here?

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:34.850
I can't find her.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.120
Could she have gone alone?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.240
Hey, Mr. Cat,
is it really true?

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:45.410
The mailbox is this way?

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.210
You're so fast!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:56.010
I've still got more biscuits!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:26.510
Leaving me back there was mean!

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:37.460
Where the heck
did that Hina-Ichigo go?

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.920
Oh dear, I wonder what
could be the matter...

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:42.200
Hello.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:45.170
I was told that my order came in?

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:46.740
Yes, yes!

00:18:46.740 --> 00:18:48.110
It is all ready!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.940
Please!
Please, please, please come in.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:55.170
Red and on one leg...

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:56.700
So this...

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.680
This is a mailbox?

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:04.420
I-If it sees me, it'll gobble me up
head first with that mouth...

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:08.150
B-But I'm sending this letter to Jun.

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:14.780
I-I can't cry.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:19.230
I'll send the letter to Jun!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:22.230
I-I can't reach it.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.360
I'm not giving up.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:27.740
I'm not giving up,
no matter what!

00:19:28.660 --> 00:19:30.600
I'm sending the letter to Jun.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:32.240
I'm sending it,
no matter what!

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:35.010
Hina is... Hina is...

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.320
Hina is sending the letter!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:49.930
Just a l-little further...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.050
I did it...

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.540
But I can't go on...

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:08.910
T-Tomoe?

00:20:10.200 --> 00:20:11.740
Hina-Ichigo?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.960
Tomoe, why are you all smiley?

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.000
Am I?

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.920
I'm being smiley?

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:21.310
Yup.

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:23.290
You look happy somehow.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:26.090
Because I'm happy.

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:27.380
Why?

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.710
I was thinking that you've changed.

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.180
Changed?

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:34.440
You're happy if I change?

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:37.060
Yeah, I am.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:42.450
Why you, who's so clingy,
worked so hard is probably because...

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:43.520
Unyu?

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:47.070
Hina-Ichigo, do you love Sakurada-kun?

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:48.150
I love him!

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:49.930
You and Nori too!

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:52.200
I love Shinku and everyone else too!

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:56.280
Then they'll be worried,
so let's take you home.

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:58.690
Hina-Ichigo!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:01.270
Oh, it's Jun!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.890
Jun! Jun!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.920
Wow, that's a little surprising.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.710
So their master's a boy.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.440
That's right, Micchan.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:17.480
Jun-kun?

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:18.280
Yeah.

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:20.940
Kana, go "ooh" with your neck.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:27.290
That's unusual for a boy
to be interested in dolls.

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:30.000
I mean when you think of dolls...

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:31.970
They're so...

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:35.170
So cute!

00:21:35.170 --> 00:21:37.870
Kana, that outfit looks supercute!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:41.260
I want the other Rozen girls, too!

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:45.470
M-M-Micchan, the mass cheek friction
is Massachusetts!

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:49.890
Oh, the Rozen Maiden
series is my dream...

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:54.980
If I could have them here,
I'd work overtime and at part-time jobs!

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:59.120
Jun-kun, there's a letter for you.

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.540
What kind of junk mail is this?

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:03.620
It's all wrinkled.

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:06.220
Talk about crappy handwriting!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.590
I'm amazed it got here.

00:23:42.330 --> 00:23:44.680
Shinku? Shinku!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:47.260
Souseiseki, have you seen Shinku?

00:23:47.640 --> 00:23:50.400
It looked like she was having tea
over there earlier...

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.390
...but I think you'd better stay away.

00:23:52.600 --> 00:23:53.810
Why?

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:56.390
Because it looked like she was
remembering something painful.

00:23:56.390 --> 00:23:57.640
Something painful?

00:23:57.850 --> 00:24:00.350
I think it's probably what
happened that time...

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:01.370
You were there too.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:04.560
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:04.560 --> 00:24:07.120
Its melody is like a dream.

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:10.910
Chapter 6
Angel
